OL,3,AAnthropic researcher believes more than
OL,4,A10% chance AI 'could kill all humans'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA top safety researcher at Anthropic
OL,7,Fhas warned AI is advancing so quickly
OL,8,Fhe believes there is a greater than 10%
OL,9,Fchance it "could kill all humans"
OL,10,Fwithin the next decade.
OL,12,FEvan Hubinger said in a post on X the
OL,13,Frisk from the models which currently
OL,14,Fexist was "low" but he was "worried"
OL,15,Fthe technology might develop and
OL,16,Fimprove itself soon to the point where
OL,17,Fit posed an existential risk to
OL,18,Fhumanity.
OL,20,FHe did not spell out how he thought AI
OL,21,Fsystems could in future result in
OL,22,Fhumans being wiped out.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
