OL,3,ABBC drops Drag Race UK after eight
OL,4,Aseries
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuPaul's Drag Race UK is leaving the
OL,7,FBBC after eight series, the broadcaster
OL,8,Fhas confirmed.
OL,10,FA spokesperson for the broadcaster said
OL,11,Fit was facing "very difficult choices"
OL,12,Fin the face of "significant financial
OL,13,Fpressures".
OL,15,FThe show is currently broadcast on BBC
OL,16,FThree and iPlayer. Future series - as
OL,17,Fwell as its spin-off vs The World -
OL,18,Fwill be broadcast on Wow Presents Plus,
OL,19,Fa streaming platform owned by the
OL,20,Fproduction company behind the show.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
